#subtitle: Setting the party's ideological direction.

= Questions of Ideology

The SPD is torn between many different ideological currents. What should be our primary ideological guidance for now?

[? if ideology != 0 : We have previously chosen a [+ ideology +] ideology. Changing it will likely have drawbacks. ?]

- @leftist: <span style="color: #94195b;">Class struggle, Anti-imperialism and radical transformation towards socialism are our primary goals.</span>
- @democratic_socialist: <span style="color: #A52A2A;">Democratic Socialism should be the party's goal.</span>
- @trade_unionist: <span style="color: #E53935;">We should work with the trade unions to improve the lives of workers.</span>
- @pragmatist: <span style="color: #de6a70;">As a Volkspartei, we should work for center left policies and support the social market economy.</span>
- @easy_discard

@leftist
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "left") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "left"; new_left_strength += 10; left_dissent -= 5; cdu_relation -= 10; fdp_relation -= 5; nationalization_support += 1; pragmatist_dissent += 5;

The <span style="color: #94195b;">radical Left</span> of the party supports a course of class struggle and our identity of being a workers' party.

@democratic_socialist
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "democratic_socialist") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "democratic_socialist"; democratic_socialist_strength += 10; democratic_socialist_dissent -= 10; new_left_dissent -= 5; pragmatist_dissent -= 5

The <span style="color: #A52A2A;">Democratic Socialists</span> support a centrist position within the party, aiming to achieve socialism by gradually reforming capitalism.

@trade_unionist
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "trade_unionist") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "trade_unionist"; trade_unionist_strength += 10; trade_unionist_dissent -= 5;

The <span style="color: #E53935;">trade unionist</span> wing of the party supports continued particpation in government in order to provide benefits to the workers, and the creation of public works programs for employment.

@pragmatist
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "pragmatist") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "pragmatist"; pragmatist_strength += 10; pragmatist_dissent -= 5; cdu_relation += 5; fdp_relation += 5; new_left_dissent += 5

The <span style="color: #de6a70;">pragmatist</span> wing of the party embraced the shift to a Volkspartei, aims to make the social market economy fairer and is most supportive of coalitions with the bourgeois parties.

@changed
on-arrival: new_left_dissent += 5; democratic_socialist_dissent += 5; trade_unionist_dissent += 5; pragmatist_dissent += 5

We have changed ideologies. Many in the party feel unmoored.
